Article 2 (Scope of Enterprises Subject to Management)
Among material resources under Article 2, subparagraph 2 of the Framework Act on Emergency Preparedness (hereinafter referred to as the "Act"), enterprises subject to management by the Minister of Gender Equality and Family shall be as follows: <Amended on September 30, 2025; October 1, 2025>
1. Korea Healthy Family Promotion Institute under Article 34-2 of the Framework Act on Healthy Families;
2. Korean Institute for Gender Equality Promotion and Education under Article 46 of the Framework Act on Gender Equality and the Korea Institute for Women's Human Rights under Article 46-2 of the same Act;
3. Korea Youth Counseling and Welfare Institute under Article 22 of the Youth Welfare Support Act;
4. Korea Youth Work Agency under Article 6 of the Youth Activity Promotion Act;
5. Other institutions or organizations deemed necessary by the Minister of Gender Equality and Family for the protection and support of women, families, and youth in emergencies.
